      <h2>Emissions reduction targets</h2>
      <p>
        In order to continue our progress to achieving Net Zero, we have adopted
        the following carbon reduction targets.
      </p>
      <p>
        We project that carbon emissions will decrease over the next five years
        to <b>0.033</b> tCO<sub>2</sub>e by 2027. This is a reduction of 75%. A
        continued reduction at this rate will result in 100% reduction by 2040.
      </p>
      <h2>Carbon Reduction Projects</h2>
      <h3>Completed Carbon Reduction Initiatives</h3>
      <p>
        The following environmental management measures and projects have been
        completed or implemented since the 2019 baseline. The carbon emission
        reduction to be achieved by these schemes equate to 0 tCO<sub>2</sub>e,
        a 100% reduction against the 2019 baseline and the measures
        will be in effect when performing the contract.
      </p>
      <p class="note">
        CECAN Ltd is a Consultancy organisation delivering projects and training
        in Policy Evaluation. Our team works from home with the occasional face
        to face meeting. Meetings have dramatically reduced since the Covid
        Pandemic and the Company strive to continue to work within Google Drive
        and Zoom thus avoiding travel and waste.
      </p>
      <p class="note">
        CECAN Ltd do not have any plans to take on business premises or increase
        staff travel. There are no company cars or use of a car pool. All travel
        is undertaken by each individual who either use their own personal
        transport for which there is no remittance from the company or they are
        reliant on public transport. We are in turn dependent on the public
        transport infrastructure to reduce its own emissions.
      </p>
      <p>In the future we hope to implement further measures such as:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Reporting individual staff emissions in their homes and personal
          vehicles.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Declaration and Sign Off</h2>
      <p>
        This Carbon Reduction Plan has been completed in accordance with PPN
        06/21 and associated guidance and reporting standard for Carbon
        Reduction Plans.
      </p>
      <p>
        Emissions have been reported and recorded in accordance with the
        published reporting standard for Carbon Reduction Plans and the GHG
        Reporting Protocol corporate standard and uses the appropriate <a
          href="https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/government-conversion-factors-for-company-reporting"
          data-wpel-link="external"
          rel="external noopener noreferrer"
          >Government emission conversion factors for greenhouse gas company
          reporting</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        Scope 1 and Scope 2 emissions have been reported in accordance with SECR
        requirements, and the required subset of Scope 3 emissions have been
        reported in accordance with the published reporting standard for Carbon
        Reduction Plans and the Corporate Value Chain (Scope 3) Standard.
      </p>
      <p>
        This Carbon Reduction Plan has been reviewed and signed off by the Board
        of Directors.
      </p>
